This repository is published so that it can be read and evaluated. You may
view the source, clone it, and run it locally for evaluation and personal
study. You may not redistribute it, offer it as a service, or use it in a
product without written permission. It is not open source at this stage; the
house runs for other people as a hosted service, where editors sign in and
steer translations on the site.

